recommend keep-going — the Ethereum family now signs both shapes a key ever meets: the flat transaction (eip155_tx) and the typed tree (eip712). Next tractable rungs: an EIP-1559 typed-transaction (type-2) digest over the same RLP, or the constant-time timing horizon (wants measurement); signing with a real identity key stays the custody gate
